menu "E-Ink English Learning Device"

    config APP_MODE_DEMO
        bool "Run the legacy 50-word display demo at boot"
        default n
        help
            Boot straight into the old 50-word / 346 ms band-refresh demo.
            Useful as a display regression test.  When disabled, the M0
            home screen + bench console is started instead.

    config APP_BENCH
        bool "Enable the UART0 bench console"
        default y
        help
            Register the `bench` command on UART0 (115200 8N1).  Disable for
            a production build that should not expose bring-up commands.

    config APP_AUDIO_RECORD_MS
        int "Default recording length (ms)"
        default 2000
        range 200 5000
        help
            Length of one M2 follow-along recording.  The training pipeline
            expects 2.0 s; 2000 ms is the default.

    config APP_AUDIO_MIC_GAIN_X100
        int "Microphone digital gain x100"
        default 100
        range 50 400
        help
            100 = unity.  MS4030/INMP441 full scale is roughly 120 dB SPL;
            raise this only if the recorded level is too low and clipping is
            not already present.

    config APP_AUDIO_MIC_POWER_GPIO
        int "MS4030 power-gate GPIO (-1 = no gate)"
        default 38
        range -1 48
        help
            GPIO38 drives an optional MOS/load switch on the MS4030 VDD rail.
            Set to -1 if the microphone is powered directly from 3.3 V.  The
            gate is raised 10 ms before capture and lowered afterwards.

    config APP_AUDIO_AMP_SD_ACTIVE_HIGH
        bool "MAX98357A SD is active high"
        default y
        help
            The MAX98357A shutdown/enable pin is active high on this board.
            Keep enabled unless the hardware is changed.

    config APP_AUDIO_TONE_AMPLITUDE
        int "Test-tone amplitude (0..32767)"
        default 6000
        range 1000 20000
        help
            Amplitude used by `bench audio tone` / `bench audio gen`.
            6000 is about -15 dBFS, loud enough to hear but not painful.

endmenu
